        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "しっぽで　きのえだに　ぶらさがり\nえものを　かんさつする。すきを\nみて　じょうくうから　おそいかかる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "꼬리로 나뭇가지에 매달려\n먹이를 관찰한다. 틈을\n봐서 상공에서 덮친다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il guette sa proie, pendu à une branche la tête en bas,\net s’en saisit à la première occasion.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es hängt kopfüber von einem Ast und beobachtet\nseine Beute. Bei Gelegenheit stürzt es sich auf sie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Espera a sus presas colgado de una rama bocabajo.\nCuando llega su oportunidad, se lanza en picado.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sta appeso ai rami con la testa in giù. Alla prima\noccasione, si butta a capofitto sulla preda.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It observes prey while hanging inverted from\nbranches. When the chance presents itself,\nit swoops!",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "尻尾で　木の枝に　ぶら下がり\n獲物を　観察する。すきを　見て\n上空から　襲いかかる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Espera a sus presas colgado de una rama bocabajo.\nCuando llega su oportunidad, se lanza en picado.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "はおとを　たてずに　そらを　とぶ。\nながい　しっぽで　えものを　つかまえ\nキバで　きゅうしょを　ひとつき。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "날갯소리를 내지 않고 하늘을 난다.\n긴 꼬리로 먹이를 잡아\n송곳니로 급소를 공격한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vole sans un bruit, et capture ses proies avec sa\nqueue pour leur infliger une morsure critique.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es fliegt völlig lautlos. Erst fängt es seine Beute mit\nseinem langen Schweif, dann saugt es sie aus.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vuela sin hacer nada de ruido. Con su larga cola\ncaptura a sus presas y las muerde con sus colmillos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
